# Sruja evaluation environment (optional)
#
# Sruja CLI does not use LLM; integration with editors is via skills + CLI
# (e.g. Sruja skill in Cursor/Copilot). The editor's AI uses its own API keys.
#
# If you use capture_timeline.sh with automatic ref selection, it may look for
# an LLM key for "suggest-refs" (that CLI command has been removed; use explicit
# refs or tags). Otherwise leave this file empty or omit it.
